<!--
  Synthetic route for testing OpenTrainer, due north from 49.0000 N 7.0000 E.
  41 valid points every 0.0009 degrees of latitude (about 100 m), four sections of about 1 km:
    points  0-10  +3 %  (200 m to 230 m)
    points 10-20  +6 %  (230 m to 290 m)
    points 20-30   0 %  (290 m)
    points 30-40  -3 %  (290 m to 260 m)
  Expected in the app: 41 points, about 4.0 km, elevation 200-290 m, data HR, Cadence, Power.
  The point without lat after point 20 must be skipped; if it were used, the maximum
  elevation would show 999 m.
-->
